{"4329030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Edge of Divinity", "steam_appid": 4329030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Edge of Divinity</strong> is an action, anime-inspired roguelite featuring our protagonists Effy and Kira as they make the Ascent through the Tower to reach the Celestial Realm that awaits them at the top.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical girls in a divine world:</strong> Help Effy find her place in the Celestial Realm and Kira in finding clues on the whereabouts of her sister through this action adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer plus online co-op action roguelite:</strong> Team up with other players to ascend the Tower, get kicked back down to basecamp, get upgrades, and try again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique fantasy biomes</strong>: Explore magical biomes with different creatures as you make the Ascent.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Edge of Divinity</strong> is an action, anime-inspired roguelite featuring our protagonists Effy and Kira as they make the Ascent through the Tower to reach the Celestial Realm that awaits them at the top.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical girls in a divine world:</strong> Help Effy find her place in the Celestial Realm and Kira in finding clues on the whereabouts of her sister through this action adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer plus online co-op action roguelite:</strong> Team up with other players to ascend the Tower, get kicked back down to basecamp, get upgrades, and try again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique fantasy biomes</strong>: Explore magical biomes with different creatures as you make the Ascent.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Ascend the Tower as Effy and Kira in this fantasy, anime-in